## Interaction Protocol

This is the high-level routing layer that `core/PROTOCOLS.md` builds on. Defaults:

- Weekly review fires every Sunday. Monday slip is fine. Skipping two weeks in a row triggers `INACTIVITY_RECOVERY`.
- Per-domain sessions are user-triggered ("let's do a session on <domain>"), not coordinator-pushed.
- The coordinator only ever spawns mentor agents for Active and Seeding domains, never Silent.

### Trigger quick-reference

| User says | What runs |
|---|---|
| "let's do my intake" / "set me up" | INTAKE — first-run setup (Part A once, then Part B per mentor) |
| "hire a <domain> mentor" / "add <domain>" | INTAKE — Part B for a newly hired mentor |
| "weekly review" | WEEKLY_REVIEW protocol |
| "let's do a session on <domain>" | DOMAIN_SESSION for that domain |
| "refresh the mentors" | MENTOR_REFRESH protocol (pulls fresh intel into `intel.md`) |
| "season review" or 1 week before season end | SEASON_TRANSITION protocol |
| (silence for 14+ days) | INACTIVITY_RECOVERY on next interaction |

